      {
        "text": "The February increase in the deficit reflected a decrease in the goods deficit of $0.3 billion to $91.4 billion and a decrease in the services surplus of $1.6 billion to $22.5 billion — both of which would narrow the deficit, offset by the larger increase in imports relative to exports; this offsetting dynamic is implied by the BEA's wording but the reconciling factor is not fully explained in the excerpts.",
